Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:38.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}鈴聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:41.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}一如既往的理科教室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:46.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}熱鬧哄吵的全員大聚集
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:49.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}絲襪精就在一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:52.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}旁邊是機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:55.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}在最棒的發明上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:11:00.02,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}寄託自己的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:05.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}連傳達不到願望也一定能夠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:09.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}實現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:14.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}My Pace Science
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:18.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}重複不斷的實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:21.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}成功將在失敗的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:26.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}盡頭等待著我們
